/**
 * READ-ONLY "clean bill of health" for one game server.
 *
 *   npx tsx scripts/verify-game-provision.ts <serverId|hostname> [--json]
 *
 * Nothing here writes anything: Proxmox GETs, one SSH session running read-only
 * commands (docker inspect/logs, systemctl show, journalctl, /proc reads,
 * free, df), and probes of the public join ports from this host. Exit code 0
 * only when every check PASSes ("CLEAN BILL OF HEALTH"); 1 if any FAILs; 2 on
 * usage/lookup errors. WARN never fails the run but is printed.
 *
 * Checks (docs/PROVISIONING-FIRST-BOOT-RCA-2026-10-02.md, "Self-check"):
 *   identity     the SSH session reaches THIS VM (SMBIOS UUID / hostname)
 *   private-ip   the server's private IP is configured on no other VM on its node
 *   container    the game container exists and is running
 *   image        the image it runs, with digest
 *   unit         systemd unit active; restart counter; restarts in the last 10 min
 *   last-errors  the game's own recent error lines (if any)
 *   ports-guest  every join port is bound inside the container's netns
 *   ports-public every join port answers from outside (TCP connect / A2S)
 *   memory       guest RAM vs the plan; Proxmox memory + balloon floor
 *   setup        /var/lib/nxeon/game-setup.state (new-style servers)
 *   mods         every installed mod's load line is in the log since the game last started
 *                (Valheim BepInEx, Rust Oxide/Carbon, Paper-family Minecraft, Terraria TShock; others skipped)
 */
