      "UDP game port. Nxeon runs Bedrock with TRANSPORT=raknet; this container is missing it, so it must be recreated " +
      `with -e TRANSPORT=${BEDROCK_TRANSPORT} (see docs/DOCUMENTATION.md, Bedrock transport incident).`
